<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wandel &amp; Goltermann.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wandel &amp; Goltermann.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interstate/Johnson Lane said Thursday it had downgraded Wandel &amp; Goltermann Technologies Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited view that the near-term weakness the company witnessed in the March quarter will persist for at least the next couple of quarters, in a more dramatic fashion than previously anticipated.</p>
<p>-- cut fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $0.42 a share from $0.70, and removed its fiscal 1998 estimate of $1.20 a share &quot;pending further review of the longer-term outlook.&quot;</p>
<p>-- stock was off 2-1/4 to 9-1/8.</p>
</text>
